X-Registry-Preview: 1, Content-Type: application/json. Cookie bytes are not logged.
Each named user uses a newly started process with DASHBOARD_DEV_AUTH_USER pinned.
Fixture grants are edited between requests and restored in finally.
Allowed request: tenant=acme, env=prod, capability=logging, version=7.1.0.
Response assertions: no-store, path=platform/tenants/acme.yaml, exactly logging: loki 7.1.0 diff.

